### Login Controller - HTTP Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = ana.garcia@ods.cr
@password = password123

# ── 1. Autenticación ──

### Login Exitoso (Gestor ODS 01)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login Exitoso (Evaluador — Sprint 3, rol evaluador)
# @name loginEvaluador
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "evaluador@ods.cr",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login Fallido (Password incorrecto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Login Fallido (Usuario no existe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "noexiste@ods.cr",
  "password": "password123"
}

# ── 2. Gestión de Sesiones ──

### Validar Token (Requiere login previo)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Refrescar Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

# ── 3. Gestión de Usuarios y Sedes ──

### Obtener todas las Sedes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/sedes

### Obtener Sede por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/sedes/1

### Obtener todos los Roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/roles

### Listar Usuarios Activos (Vista)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/vistas/usuarios-activos

### Resumen General del Sistema (Vista)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/vistas/resumen-general

# ── 4. Registro de eventos de login (tabla auditoria_login) ──

### Eventos de login recientes (Últimos 7 días)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/vistas/auditoria?dias=7

### Intentos fallidos recientes (Últimas 24 horas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auditoria/fallidos?horas=24
